# shell: desktop
# CW-019: the scroll bar highlights with the focus border -- framed in the
# focus colour while its window is the focused one, plain the moment
# another window takes the keyboard.
wait 10
expect-pixel 499 200 0000e5
note the Trash window takes focus; the first window's bar goes plain
click 170 30
wait 2
click 170 30
wait 8
expect-pixel 499 200 f0f0f0
quit
